For exothermic reaction, $\Delta$H = -ve means the temperature $T_{2}$ is higher than $T_{1}$.

$\therefore [ {{1 \over {{T_2}}} - {1 \over {{T_1}}}} ]$ is negative.

So log K'_{p} - log $K_{p}$ = -ve

$\Rightarrow$ log $K_{p}$ > log K'_{p}

